  "prefLabel": "Ac 103.05 Functions of the Board",
  "priorExpiration": "2007-07-25",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ac 103.05 Functions of the Board. The duties of the board include:\n\n(a) Adopting rules relative to:\n\n(1) Peer reviews;\n\n(2) Disciplinary matters;\n\n(3) Qualifications of applicants;\n\n(4) Ethical and professional standards;\n\n(5) Presiding over hearings; and\n\n(6) Any other matters necessary for the proper administration of RSA 309-B;\n\n(b) The adjudication of complaints against licensees; and\n\n(c) All other functions set forth in RSA 309-B.\n\nSource. #6901, eff 12-4-98; ss by #8810, INTERIM, eff 1-25-07, EXPIRED: 7-25-07\n\nNew. #9032, eff 11-21-07; ss by #10053, eff 1-1-12 (from Ac 102.07); ss by #13995, eff 8-9-24",
